{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_lot_e2", "label": "Lot E2 \u2014 Tempo, transposition, boucle et m\u00e9tronome", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_pitchcorrection", "label": "pitchCorrection \u2014 deux chemins de traitement", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "false : computedPlaybackRate = playbackRate * detune, la hauteur suit le tempo. true : playbackRate \u00e9tire le temps et detune transpose via setTransposeSemitones, rendant tempo et tonalit\u00e9 ind\u00e9pendants. Se fixe \u00e0 la construction via createBufferSource(pitchCorrection?), donc en changer impose de recr\u00e9er le n\u0153ud \u2014 sans obstacle puisqu'il est d\u00e9j\u00e0 recr\u00e9\u00e9 \u00e0 chaque reprise et \u00e0 chaque saut."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_correction_a_la_demande", "label": "Correction de hauteur activ\u00e9e seulement hors du neutre", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00c0 1\u00d7 sans transposition le signal ne traverse pas le stretcher : pas de co\u00fbt processeur ni d'artefact sur une \u00e9coute normale, ce qui compte sur un appareil de 2018. Franchir la fronti\u00e8re recr\u00e9e le n\u0153ud \u00e0 la position courante."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_piege_detune_zero", "label": "Pi\u00e8ge du retour \u00e0 detune = 0", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le natif garde `if (detune != 0.0f) stretch_->setTransposeSemitones(detune)` : repasser \u00e0 z\u00e9ro exact saute l'appel et le stretcher reste cal\u00e9 sur la derni\u00e8re valeur non nulle. Il faut revenir par 0,01 cent \u2014 inaudible mais non nul \u2014 et le commenter, sinon quelqu'un \u00ab corrigera \u00bb la valeur."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_bornes_natives", "label": "Bornes natives : playbackRate [0,3], detune \u00b112 demi-tons", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_reglage_labo", "label": "R\u00e9glage \u00e0 paliers r\u00e9utilisable (src/components/audio/reglage-labo.tsx)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Boutons \u2212 et +, cible tactile de 44 px, appui long pour revenir au neutre. Pas de curseur continu : sur un morceau qu'on travaille on veut des paliers reproductibles, pas une valeur qu'on ne retrouvera pas demain. Tempo 0,5\u00d7\u20131,5\u00d7 par 0,05 ; transposition \u22126 \u00e0 +6 demi-tons."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_boucle_ab", "label": "Boucle A/B (loop, loopStart, loopEnd)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00c0 poser avant start, donc \u00e0 r\u00e9appliquer \u00e0 chaque recr\u00e9ation du n\u0153ud. Zone teint\u00e9e sur la waveform pour qu'on voie ce qu'on boucle sans lire deux nombres."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_metronome", "label": "M\u00e9tronome et calage manuel de la phase", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La base ne contient que le bpm, jamais l'instant du premier temps : aubiotrack sort les positions des battements mais le conteneur n'en garde que la m\u00e9diane des intervalles. Un clic au bon tempo mais d\u00e9cal\u00e9 est pire qu'aucun clic. D'o\u00f9 un bpm pr\u00e9rempli et modifiable, et un bouton \u00ab Caler \u00bb qui fixe la phase sur la position courante \u2014 aucune migration, et \u00e7a marche m\u00eame quand la d\u00e9tection s'est tromp\u00e9e."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_clicsdanshorizon", "label": "clicsDansHorizon(position, phase, bpm, horizon) \u2014 src/lib/metronome.ts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Calcul pur et test\u00e9 : rend les instants de clic en temps du tampon dans [position, position + horizon). Refuse un bpm hors de [30, 300] en rendant [] plut\u00f4t que de boucler \u00e0 l'infini."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_ordonnanceur_clics", "label": "Ordonnanceur de clics (setInterval 100 ms, avance 300 ms)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chaque clic est un OscillatorNode court pass\u00e9 par un GainNode en enveloppe percussive, branch\u00e9 sur la destination et non sur le gain du morceau, sinon l'\u00e9galiseur du lot E3 filtrerait le clic. Conversion tampon\u2192contexte : tContexte = maintenant + (tTampon \u2212 positionCourante) / tempo, le tempo au d\u00e9nominateur car \u00e0 0,8\u00d7 une seconde de morceau dure 1,25 s r\u00e9elle."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_lot_e2", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_lot_e1", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_lot_e2", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_labo_audio", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_pitchcorrection", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_audiobufferbasesourcenode", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_pitchcorrection", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_recreation_source_node", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_correction_a_la_demande", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_pitchcorrection", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_piege_detune_zero", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_pitchcorrection", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_bornes_natives", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_reglage_labo", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_reglage_labo", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_labo_audio", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_boucle_ab", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_waveform", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_boucle_ab", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_recreation_source_node", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_ordonnanceur_clics", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_clicsdanshorizon", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_ordonnanceur_clics", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_lot_e3", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_metronome", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_clicsdanshorizon", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_metronome", "target": "mobile_dev_plan_detection_tonalite_krumhansl", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_ordonnanceur_clics", "target": "mobile_dev_plan_decodage_a_samplerate_contexte", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_metronome", "target": "mobile_dev_plan_monetisation_credits", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "AMBIGUOUS", "confidence_score": 0.2, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "graphe_audio_du_labo", "label": "Graphe audio du labo : source d\u00e9cod\u00e9e, gain, effets et clic du m\u00e9tronome", "nodes": ["docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_graphe_gainnode", "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_recreation_source_node", "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_pitchcorrection", "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_boucle_ab", "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_ordonnanceur_clics", "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_lot_e3"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e2-tempo-transposition.md"}]}